// RUN: cd %corpus && ! %zomc compile --check 05-statements/inherent_method_call_unsupported_neg_01.zom > %t 2>&1
// RUN: %FileCheck %s --input-file %t

// The checker now accepts the shared-receiver inherent call and produces its
// call facts, but semantic HIR does not lower a Method owner or the implicit
// `this` receiver yet. The enclosing method body is rejected as a capability
// gap (ZOM4099), never as an internal compiler error.

// CHECK-LITERAL: Error [ZOM4099]: this function body uses a construct the compiler cannot generate code for yet
// CHECK-LITERAL:   --> conformance/05-statements/inherent_method_call_unsupported_neg_01.zom:3:3
